'''Rahgot''' is a high-ranked [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] whose sarcophagus is in [[Skyrim:Forelhost|Forelhost]], on the mountain peak south-southeast of [[Skyrim:Riften|Riften]]. He wields a [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest Staff (Rahgot)|dragon priest staff]], and carries his eponymous [[Skyrim:Rahgot_(item)|mask]].

Rahgot led the last remnants of the [[Skyrim:Dragon Cult|Dragon Cult]] until a legion of King Harald's soldiers discovered his hidden stronghold. 

For historical information, see the [[Lore:Rahgot|lore article]].

Rahgot knows the following spells: [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]], [[Skyrim:Conjure Flame Atronach|Conjure Flame Atronach]], [[Skyrim:Fireball|Fireball]], [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Command Daedra|Command Daedra]], [[Skyrim:Incinerate|Incinerate]], and [[Skyrim:Flame Cloak|Flame Cloak]].
